[12.32, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;245mNote what the agent never did: it never edited a rendered manifest\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.51, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;245mto make a check go green. Every fix changed an input and the whole\u001b[0m\r\n"]
